  "description": "Hong Deok-Hye becomes 'Seo Na-In', the main character of the romance novel \"Love is Takeout!\" that she read. Unlike the ending of the novel where she becomes the lover of the main male lead, 'Cha Min-Ho', Deok-Hye dreams of love with the sub-male lead, 'Min Gyu-Hyeon'. However, her murder occurs at the cafe where Na-In works. The victim is Gyu-Hyeon's girlfriend, and the suspect is Gyu-Hyeon. Embarrassed by the developments that differ from the content of her novel, Deok-Hye searches for a way to return to the real world.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
